stringTest is test
stringTest purpose "strlen counts to the 0 byte, strcmp and memcmp give byte differences, strchr, strrchr, strstr, and memchr find, strspn and strcspn count, and the copies copy"
stringTest verifies cStringLength countsToZero
stringTest verifies compareStrings ordersLikeGlibc
stringTest verifies memoryCompare comparesRanges
stringTest verifies stringFind findsCharacter
stringTest verifies stringSearch findsText
stringTest verifies spanOf spansSet
stringTest verifies duplicate duplicatesBytes
